PAW — PDF Architecture Wizard

Third-party components (runtime):

pypdfium2 — BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0 (bundles PDFium: BSD-3-Clause)
pikepdf — MPL-2.0 (file-level copyleft; unmodified — source at https://github.com/pikepdf/pikepdf)
reportlab — BSD-3-Clause
pdfplumber — MIT (depends on pdfminer.six, MIT)
Pillow — MIT-CMU
fontTools — MIT

Fonts are NOT bundled. Consumers supply their own
(e.g. Noto Sans CJK KR, OFL-1.1 — embedding in output documents is permitted by that licence).
